OL,3,GNEWSARising costs having 'massive
OL,4,Aimpact' on farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA north Devon farmer has warned British
OL,7,Fagriculture is facing a combination of
OL,8,Frising costs, global instability and
OL,9,Flivestock disease.
OL,11,FDavid Chugg, who is also regional
OL,12,Fchairman of the National Farmers' Union
OL,13,F(NFU), said drought conditions, fuel
OL,14,Fand fertiliser costs and the continuing
OL,15,Feffects of bluetongue disease were
OL,16,Fcreating major challenges for
OL,17,Fproducers.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
